<%- include('../partials/header') %><section class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">ARSENAL DE RETOS</p><h1>Elige tu misión</h1><p>Los laboratorios se ejecutan de forma aislada. Investiga, aprende y envía la flag cuando estés listo.</p></section><div class="grid"><% challenges.forEach((challenge) => { %><article class="card challenge accent-<%= challenge.presentation.accent %>"><div class="challenge-top"><span class="challenge-icon"><%= challenge.presentation.icon === 'code' ? '</>' : challenge.presentation.icon === 'database' ? '▣' : '◈' %></span><span class="points"><%= challenge.points %> XP</span></div><p class="tag"><%= challenge.presentation.label %></p><h2><%= challenge.title %></h2><p><%= challenge.presentation.mission %></p><div class="challenge-meta"><span><%= challenge.difficulty %></span><span class="solved"><%= challenge.solved ? '✓ Completado' : '○ Pendiente' %></span></div><a class="card-link" href="/retos/<%= challenge.slug %>"><%= challenge.solved ? 'Revisar misión' : 'Abrir reto' %> <b>→</b></a></article><% }) %></div><%- include('../partials/footer') %>
